WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:02.000
Brother Biaozhi

00:02.080 --> 00:03.480
Long time no see

00:03.880 --> 00:05.480
The situation is clear now

00:05.560 --> 00:06.640
For the world

00:06.720 --> 00:08.120
For the city's soldiers

00:08.240 --> 00:08.920
Open the gates

00:09.000 --> 00:10.280
Surrender to me

00:10.360 --> 00:11.040
In the future

00:11.120 --> 00:13.120
I will not treat you poorly

00:13.200 --> 00:14.600
Enough talk
